hedgehog-3pt-analysed.ogxm is a match exported by HedgeHog (hedgehog-bg.com),
taken from the test data of AnkiGammon
(github.com/Deinonychus999/AnkiGammon, tests/data/hedgehog/analysis.ogxm),
distributed under the MIT License:

